  "note": "[N] nasqret/z-in-q-lean, proved, through its dependency: ndep carries it with files identical to [F]'s; [N] has no declaration of its own. The parts give m0 <= N^6, success of N^4*m0 (so M0 <= Ns^10), the bad-place reduction to (2,6) and the odd coefficient extraction, for every N >= 1; the per-prime order bound uses a trivial point count (order <= 2|k|+1) in place of Hasse's bound.",
